    imageAlt: 'Developer writing code on a laptop, representing website development companies in the UAE',
    title: 'Website Development Company in the UAE: A Complete 2026 Guide',
    excerpt: 'Choosing a website development company in the UAE affects your business for years, not months. Here is what actually matters — beyond just "does it look good."',
    metaTitle: 'Website Development Company UAE — Complete 2026 Guide | Zenexio',
    metaDescription: 'A complete guide to choosing a website development company in the UAE — process, pricing, technology choices, and the red flags worth watching for.',
    keywords: 'website development company UAE, web development agency Dubai, custom website developer UAE, business website company Dubai, e-commerce website development UAE, website design and development Dubai',
    body: [
      { h2: 'Your Website Outlives the Decision to Build It' },
      { p: 'A website built in a rush, on the cheapest available quote, tends to become a years-long liability — slow to update, awkward to maintain, and quietly costing conversions every month it stays that way. Choosing a website development company in the UAE is a decision with a much longer shadow than the few weeks the project itself takes, which is exactly why it deserves more evaluation than comparing three quotes and picking the lowest.' },
      { h2: 'Custom Development vs. Page Builders and Templates' },
      { p: 'Page builders and templated themes are genuinely appropriate for simple, budget-constrained sites with no unusual requirements — there is no need to over-engineer a straightforward five-page brochure site. Custom development earns its higher cost when a business needs specific functionality a template cannot cleanly provide, full design flexibility that does not fight a theme\'s constraints, or performance that a bloated page-builder simply cannot match.' },
      { p: 'A good UAE web development company will tell you honestly which category your project falls into, rather than always pushing the more expensive custom build regardless of actual need.' },
      { h2: 'What a Strong Development Process Looks Like' },
      { p: 'Discovery before design — understanding your business, audience, and goals before a single wireframe is drawn. A clear technology recommendation with reasoning, not just "we use WordPress for everything" regardless of project fit. Defined revision rounds and a realistic timeline communicated upfront, not discovered through delays. And performance treated as a design constraint from day one — see our <a href="/blogs/performance-first-web-design">Performance-First Web Design</a> guide for why this matters more than most businesses realise.' },
      { h2: 'Questions Worth Asking Before You Commit' },
      { p: 'Who owns the final code and hosting access after launch? Vague or restrictive answers here are a serious red flag. What is included in ongoing maintenance, and is it optional or mandatory? Some UAE agencies quietly lock clients into expensive mandatory maintenance contracts that were never clearly disclosed upfront. Can they show examples of similar projects — an e-commerce build if you need e-commerce, not just a generic portfolio of unrelated brochure sites?' },
      { p: 'Ask specifically about mobile performance and Core Web Vitals — a beautiful desktop mockup that loads slowly on mobile in Dubai\'s mobile-first market is a genuinely costly mistake.' },
      { h2: 'Industry-Specific Considerations' },
      { p: 'Different business types need meaningfully different website approaches — see our dedicated guides for <a href="/blogs/real-estate-website-design-uae">real estate</a>, <a href="/blogs/clinic-salon-website-design-dubai">clinics and salons</a>, and <a href="/blogs/law-firm-consultancy-website-design-dubai">law firms and consultancies</a> for what actually converts in each category, rather than a one-size-fits-all approach.' },
      { h2: 'How Zenexio Approaches Website Development' },
      { p: 'Zenexio is a website development company serving businesses across Dubai, the UAE, and India, building custom, performance-first websites with full client ownership of code and hosting. Reach us at <a href="mailto:info@zenexio.pro">info@zenexio.pro</a>, <a href="tel:+971503848523">+971 503 848523</a>, or via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for a scoped quote within one business day.' }
    ]
